# Intentionally empty. The compose file mounts docker/grafana/provisioning over Grafana's
# whole provisioning directory, so a subdirectory that is missing here is missing in the
# container too — and Grafana logs a scary "can't read provisioning files" error at every
# start for each one. Nothing in this stack provisions plugins; the directory exists so that
# error does not, because a log line that looks like a failure and is not costs someone
# an investigation.
